// The menu bar icon. Generated by scripts/generate-tray-icon.mjs (run
// `node scripts/generate-tray-icon.mjs --check` to detect drift); see
// that file for why the bytes live in source instead of assets/.
//
// It is a *template* image: alpha-only artwork that AppKit tints to
// match the menu bar, so it stays legible in light menu bars, dark menu
// bars, and while the menu bar item is highlighted. That is also why
// the artwork is monochrome by construction -- a colored status dot
// baked in here would be inverted to nonsense on selection.
